  "title": "Prioritize Future Gains over Instant Gratification",
  "description": "Prioritize future gains over instant gratification. Here’s how: - Visualize future benefits: Imagine how your future self will thank you. - Delay small rewards: Practice waiting 5–10 minutes before giving in to temptations. - Break the pattern: Use reminders like sticky notes to focus on long-term goals. Example: Choose fruit over chocolate by reminding yourself how good you’ll feel sticking to your health goals.",
